              "ImageDescription": {
                "value": "French garden of the Chambord Castle, Loir-et-Cher, France\n<div style=\"margin:.5em 0;overflow:hidden\">\n<table cellspacing=\"8\" cellpadding=\"0\" lang=\"en\" class=\"layouttemplate\" style=\"margin:0;width:100%;border:2px solid #999933;background:var(--background-color-success-subtle,#F9FFF0);direction:ltr;color:inherit;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:60px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c6/Logo_monument_historique_-_rouge.svg/60px-Logo_monument_historique_-_rouge.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c6/Logo_monument_historique_-_rouge.svg/120px-Logo_monument_historique_-_rouge.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"800\" data-file-height=\"800\"></span></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"layouttemplateargs\" style=\"display:none;speak:none;\" title=\"template=M%C3%A9rim%C3%A9e 1%3DPA00098405 2%3DIA00012822 3%3D 3%3D 3%3D type%3Dclass%C3%A9\"> </span>\n<p>This building is <i>classé au titre des <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Monument_historique\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Monument historique\">monuments historiques de la France</a></i>. It is indexed in the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Base_M%C3%A9rim%C3%A9e\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Base Mérimée\">base Mérimée</a>, a database of architectural heritage maintained by the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Minister_of_Culture_(France)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Minister of Culture (France)\">French Ministry of Culture</a>, under the references <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.pop.culture.gouv.fr/notice/merimee/PA00098405\">PA00098405</a> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"h